lxqt-schedule source package
============================

This package uses the 3.0 (native) source format and debhelper compat 13
with the CMake build system. No separate upstream tarball, generated source,
or preparatory code-generation step is required.

Install the Build-Depends from debian/control, then run:

    dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc

The native package version follows CMakeLists.txt. The changelog distribution
and debian/bianbu.conf retain the Bianbu resolute-customization target.
